        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Oh, I see.\r\n\r\nThe current standard approach to this kind of problem is via using `pcall()`:\r\n\r\n```lua\r\nlocal ok, surround = pcall(require, 'mini.surround')\r\nif ok then surround.setup() end\r\n```",
